# The atoms of host-name resolution (spikes/S14, D42): dangerous_bees_dns's request and answers, the reasons it answers
# with, and the dial actor's failure reasons ({:dns, reason}). Listed so that every program that resolves holds them in its
# atom table in one order (D30; a resolver is a library unit's FFI worker and SD-3 numbers atoms per unit otherwise).
resolve
resolved
resolve_failed
close
nxdomain
no_address
temporary
bad_name
failed
dns
not_loopback
no_usable_address
not_built_yet
